  "title": "China and North Korea Expand Cooperation via New Bridge",
  "summary": "China and North Korea have officially opened the New Yalu River Bridge, marking a significant expansion of their shared interests. The bridge connects Dandong, China, and Sinuiju, North Korea, and is expected to boost regional trade and collaboration. The North Korean leader Kim Jong-un has visited China, further solidifying their economic and diplomatic ties.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "China and North Korea have officially opened the New Yalu River Bridge after a 12-year delay, enhancing regional trade and collaboration.",
