      "title": "Kim Jong-un crosses newly opened bridge into China",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/oct/24/kim-jong-un-crosses-newly-opened-bridge-into-china",
      "description": "<p>North Korean leader travels over New Yalu River Bridge to meet senior Communist party member</p><p>Kim Jong-un has visited China, inaugurating a bridge that connects the two countries and saying he hopes to expand cooperation with his neighbour.</p><p>The North Korean leader arrived in the Chinese border city of Dandong on Saturday after crossing the New Yalu River Bridge, according to South Korea’s unification ministry, which handles affairs related to North Korea, and China’s official Xinhua news agency.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/oct/24/kim-jong-un-crosses-newly-opened-bridge-into-china\">Continue reading...</a>",
